      "content": "Find the Length of a String"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We use the strlen() function to find the length of a string. For example,"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "c",
      "content": "1#include <stdio.h>\n2#include <string.h>\n3\n4int main() {\n5\n6  char series[] = \"Squid Game\";\n7\n8\n9  printf(\"%zu\", strlen(series));    // 10\n10\n11  return 0;\n12}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In the above example,"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "#include <string.h> - imports the header file in our program",
        "%zu - format specifier to print the returned value of strlen()",
        "strlen(series) - finds the length of the string series"
      ]
    },
